	(text_box "This relay provides logic switched power supplies for the troll control system.\n\nTSR.IGN.75 derives from the engine ignition switch ACC terminal via the helm TROLL\nswitch. TSR.COIL derives from the engine panel tachometer alarm connection (which is\nactive-low).\n\nIGN.75.TRL.SBY.A is high when engine RPM is below the tachometer alarm threshold;\nIGN.75.TRL.SBY.B is high when engine RPM is above the tachometer alarm threshold."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19.05 168.275 0)
		(size 91.44 18.415)
		(stroke
			(width -0.0001)
