	(text_box "The F9 supply derives from the main DC distribution cabinet via the ship's main isolator,\nan electrically operated contactor which can be used to disable all of the vessel's\nnon-essential (i.e. safety critical) systems.\n\nThe contactor state us determined by its connection polarity which is determined by the\nMAIN ISOLATOR RELAY (see below)."
